'''The Bastion''' is a location in the {{Zone|Crimson Isle}}. [[Piglin Guard]]s wander around {{zone|The Bastion}} and if they see a player, they will kick them out.

{{ZoneText|Don't anger the guards.}}

== Entering ==
The player will have to enter '''{{zone|The Bastion}}''' during the [[Mage Faction]] questline, to find the [[Dean]]'s stolen research papers, and again when given the Rescue Mission at the Town Board when the player is in the [[Mage Faction]]. When entering '''{{zone|The Bastion}}''' during a quest, all abilities are disabled, {{stat|spd}} is capped at 100 and {{PotN|Jump Boost}} doesn't work.

